<PaperBackground>
	<MudText Typo=Typo.h4>Applying lessons learned from D4</MudText>
	<MudDivider/>
	<MudText Typo=Typo.h4>Problem</MudText>
	<MudText Typo=Typo.body1>
		On D4, I did a ton of work to support automated performance testing.
		A commmon problem that we ran into was that I was THE person for automated perforamnce testing.
		This made me both a blocker for teams who wanted new features and a big absence if I went on vacation.</MudText>
	<MudText Typo=Typo.h4>Diablo Platform Tools</MudText>

	<MudText Typo=Typo.h4>Solution</MudText>

	<MudText Typo=Typo.body1>The solution I championed was self-service testing.  
		Gone were the days when I was doing all the automated performance testing and instead I focued on building tools.   </MudText>
	<MudText Typo=Typo.h4>Static Archives</MudText>
	<MudDivider />
	
	<MudText Typo=Typo.h4>Console checkout</MudText>
	<MudDivider />
